 ## Background
-The method is based on NeRF-Art [S1], which introduces text-driven neural radiance fields stylization. It builds on VolSDF [S1] as the base NeRF model. The approach addresses the limitations of single-metric losses in generating visually consistent stylized images. The "No conditional adversarial objective" variant is discussed in Pix2NeRF [S2] to highlight the role of adversarial training in conditional GANs for NeRF translation.
+The method is based on NeRF-Art [S3], which introduces text-driven neural radiance fields stylization. It builds on VolSDF [S3] as the base NeRF model. The approach addresses the limitations of single-metric losses in generating visually consistent stylized images. The "No conditional adversarial objective" variant is discussed in Pix2NeRF [S4] to highlight the role of adversarial training in conditional GANs for NeRF translation.
 
